text = "[b][font_size=24]Controls[/font_size][/b]
• Move Left / Right — [code]A[/code] / [code]D[/code]
• Jump — [code]Space[/code]
• Attack — [code]Left Mouse Button[/code] (hold to auto-swing)
• Interact / Use shrine or heal — [code]W[/code]
• Go through a door — walk into it and press [code]W[/code]
• Abilities — [code]Q[/code], [code]T[/code], [code]F[/code], [code]X[/code], [code]Z[/code]


[b][font_size=24]Abilities[/font_size][/b]
You play as a [b]Bard[/b]. New abilities unlock each time you advance your Sequence. Hover over the ability slots in the bottom-left corner to see what each one does.

[b]Q — Bardic Song[/b] (unlocked at start)
Hold Q to charge a musical aura; release to convert charge time into a movement and attack speed buff.

[b]T — Sunshine Burst[/b] (unlocked at Sequence 8)
Fire a radiant solar projectile in the direction you're facing. Also activates a temporary Sun Eyes light aura.

[b]F — Theurgical Purification[/b] (unlocked at Sequence 7)
Cleanse all debuffs from yourself and deal holy damage in a ring around you. Undead enemies below 30% HP are instantly destroyed. Also permanently increases your max HP.

[b]X — Truth Seal[/b] (unlocked at Sequence 6)
Brand the nearest enemy, stunning them in place for 15 seconds. A branded enemy that breaks the seal takes bonus holy damage.

[b]Z — Pure White Ray[/b] (unlocked at Sequence 5)
Launch a blazing divine beam that tears through enemies. Grants permanent immunity to fear and keeps Sun Eyes always active.


[b][font_size=24]Advancing Your Sequence[/font_size][/b]
You begin at [b]Sequence 9[/b]. Advance down through each tier to reach [b]Sequence 5[/b].

At the end of each branch you'll find a [b]Sequence Shrine[/b] — a golden glowing interactable. Stand near it and press [code]W[/code] to advance. Each shrine requires:
• [b]2 Materials[/b] — found in Material rooms. Walk over them to collect.
• [b]3 Enemy Drops[/b] — green pickups left by defeated enemies. Walk over them to collect.

If you don't have enough, the shrine won't activate — clear more rooms and come back.


[b][font_size=24]Sequence Doors[/font_size][/b]
Branches are gated by [b]Sequence Doors[/b] labeled with the Sequence required to pass. A door marked \"Seq 7\" stays locked until you reach Sequence 7 or lower. Walk up to a door and press [code]W[/code] to pass through.


[b][font_size=24]Healing[/font_size][/b]
Some rooms contain a [b]Heal[/b] interactable marked with a green glow. Stand near it and press [code]W[/code] to fully restore your HP. Each heal can only be used once.


[b][font_size=24]The Boss[/font_size][/b]
Once you reach [b]Sequence 5[/b], a path opens to the [b]Boss Room[/b]. There you'll face [b]The Sequence Warden[/b] — a corrupted knight with three escalating phases:

• [b]Phase I[/b] — aggressive melee, chases you down and swings hard.
• [b]Phase II[/b] (below 66% HP) — speeds up and fires a dark orb each attack. Screen flashes orange on transition.
• [b]Phase III[/b] (below 33% HP) — faster still, fires a 3-way spread of orbs every swing. Screen flashes red.

Each phase transition grants the boss a brief window of invulnerability — back off until it fades. Defeat the Warden to win the run.


[b][font_size=24]The Goal[/font_size][/b]
Advance from Sequence 9 to 5, unlock all five abilities, and slay The Sequence Warden.

If you die at any point, the run ends. Good luck."

